Package: aprs-beacon
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Marek Kudlacz <marek@kudlacz.com>
Depends: bash (>= 4.2), coreutils, bsdutils, mawk | gawk, cron
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/marek/aprs_beacon
Description: APRS-IS position beacon for Pi-Star hotspots
 Periodically sends the hotspot's position to APRS-IS so it shows up on
 aprs.fi, using the callsign, server and passcode already configured for
 APRSGateway and the location configured in MMDVMHost.
